# Implementation Plan (Final) — Phase 1: Zero-Trust Encrypted Vault & Session Auth

This document contains the production-grade implementation plan for **Phase 1: Seed-Phrase Account & Client-Side Encrypted Vault**, fully focused on audited, production-ready libraries and robust software engineering standards.

---

## 🛡️ Production Architecture & Security Boundary

```text
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                              BROWSER (RAM & Local)                     │
│                                                                        │
│  [ Mnemonic (RAM) ] ──► [ Seed (RAM) ] ──► [ Private Key (RAM) ]       │
│                                                          │             │
│  [ Password ] ──► [ KDF (Argon2id) ] ──► [ AES-256-GCM Encrypt ]       │
│                                                          │             │
│                                                          ▼             │
│                                           [ IndexedDB Vault Record ]   │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                   │
                                   =======================================
                                          TRUST & SECURITY BOUNDARY
                                   =======================================
                                   │ (Wallet Address + Public Key Only)
                                   ▼
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                              BACKEND (Node.js & Postgres)              │
│                                                                        │
│   oRPC Auth Router ──► JWT (HttpOnly Cookie) ──► DB User/Wallet Record │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

