## 🎯 Production Architectural Specifications

| Feature | Production Specification |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Vault Persistence** | **IndexedDB** (`Uint8Array` binary, async API, structured storage) |
| **Crypto Libraries** | Production audited libraries: `bip39`, `@noble/hashes` (Argon2id), `@noble/secp256k1` |
| **Entropy Options** | **12 words (128-bit)** & **24 words (256-bit)** entropy support |
| **Key Derivation (KDF)** | **Strict Separation**: `PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA512` for BIP39 seed; **`Argon2id`** for Vault password key ($m=64\text{MB}$, $t=3$, $p=1$) |
| **Memory Security** | **Memory Zeroization** (`buffer.fill(0)`) + Auto-clear on 10m idle timeout |
| **Backend Registration**| **Wallet Identity Registration** (`walletAddress` + `publicKey` bound to User Record) |
| **Session Model** | **Dual Cookie Strategy** (Access Token 15m + Refresh Token 7d, `HttpOnly`, `SameSite=Lax`) |
| **State Architecture** | **Dual State Separation**: Session (Authenticated via backend) vs. Vault (Locked / Unlocked via Zustand) |

